      "club_name": "[{\"x\":0.18448637696776943,\"width\":0.7358490306032455,\"y\":0.8938110750630519,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"Talent Time, for its fifth year, was held on 28th November and the first week of\"},{\"x\":0.12159331072164435,\"width\":0.7966456731758584,\"y\":0.879360465066534,\"height\":0.016079274528577936,\"text\":\"December. Like the previous two years, it was organised by the Let's Get Together Club\"},{\"x\":0.12159329274367402,\"width\":0.3144654124162159,\"y\":0.8677325581106379,\"height\":0.014677865342130891,\"text\":\"with the help of Rev. Fr. Deignan.\"},{\"x\":0.18645937032498708,\"width\":0.7318665871391404,\"y\":0.8489152262790483,\"height\":0.017398449031071905,\"text\":\"The music contest, unlike the previous ones, was divided into five sections: In-\"},{\"x\":0.11949685999763637,\"width\":0.7987421130864887,\"y\":0.8357558141266115,\"height\":0.016035716774409292,\"text\":\"strumental Solo, Instrumental Group, Solo Vocal, Group Vocal （Folk）， and Group Vocal\"},{\"y\":0.8241042346526198,\"width\":0.7987421130864888,\"x\":0.1194968613288732,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"（Hit）. Talent Time was very successful this year for the students seemed very interested\"},{\"y\":0.8099652785791311,\"width\":0.7968375635730245,\"x\":0.11940093121275065,\"height\":0.015243862040268175,\"text\":\"in it. Their enthusiasm was shown by the large number of entries. We had the honour\"},{\"y\":0.797965116650059,\"width\":0.7966456731758584,\"x\":0.12159331924715079,\"height\":0.013109801724213277,\"text\":\"of having Mrs. Yung and Rev. Br. Tsui as our judges and Patrick Chan the Master of\"},{\"y\":0.7846286977798544,\"width\":0.10394151459745048,\"x\":0.12094078651629141,\"height\":0.013658779529484466,\"text\":\"Ceremonles.\"},{\"y\":0.7648562196377016,\"width\":0.6607179686581315,\"x\":0.2577333959257369,\"height\":0.019837542853836876,\"text\":\"of the increase in the number of entries, the contest lasted five days.\"},{\"y\":0.75115133405315,\"width\":0.7465978211540157,\"x\":0.16969725513043754,\"height\":0.0209923660328023,\"text\":\"was an increase of nearly thirty entries for the Solo Vocal section and so, two\"},{\"y\":0.7392479349594466,\"width\":0.7968285489732773,\"x\":0.11941724919422628,\"height\":0.016831771403259865,\"text\":\"preliminary rounds had to be held on 28th November and Ist December. Five winners\"},{\"y\":0.7267100978713632,\"width\":0.33542975410468606,\"x\":0.11949686718245767,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"were selected from the eight finalists.\"},{\"y\":0.7107491854636558,\"width\":0.731656150781985,\"x\":0.18448639524392801,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"The Instrumental Group section had a relatively small number of entries and it\"},{\"y\":0.6939906903045956,\"width\":0.7990422935162864,\"x\":0.11725959847764042,\"height\":0.020290423216182907,\"text\":\"took place on 2nd December together with the Group Vocal （Folk） section. Six groups\"},{\"y\":0.6816860467525805,\"width\":0.7987421130864887,\"x\":0.11740041861398882,\"height\":0.016033823094072863,\"text\":\"entered the Final out of the twenty odd ones. On the same night, the frst Semi-Final\"},{\"y\":0.6714582931915538,\"width\":0.3378369967441792,\"x\":0.11725463734311248,\"height\":0.014641430634240615,\"text\":\"for the Solo Vocal section was held.\"},{\"y\":0.47817589483315437,\"width\":0.1949685528271622,\"x\":0.11530398256964745,\"height\":0.04217294202177069,\"text\":\"Ealent\"},{\"y\":0.47524430047212163,\"width\":0.15513626629747768,\"x\":0.7253668768496485,\"height\":0.04234527687296419,\"text\":\"Eime\"},{\"y\":0.35309446281575674,\"width\":0.12578616496648642,\"x\":0.45283018921486995,\"height\":0.011731118565661891,\"text\":\"Oh, Danny Boy！\"},{\"y\":0.31737616183094897,\"width\":0.7341237969815675,\"x\":0.18013429281725546,\"height\":0.01964612271187749,\"text\":\"The Instrumental Solo section was divided into four sections — piano, violin，\"},{\"y\":0.30274161251437115,\"width\":0.7968620809876235,\"x\":0.11518651846051126,\"height\":0.018787961829368816,\"text\":\"flute and drums. It was really grand to see Form I students participating and winning in\"},{\"y\":0.29215116276180064,\"width\":0.7651991319342368,\"x\":0.11320754916216225,\"height\":0.014689228045435598,\"text\":\"them. It took place on 3rd December and was followed by the second Semi-Final of\"},{\"y\":0.274949673426059,\"width\":0.7969683039782749,\"x\":0.11512372303131364,\"height\":0.0199083396588553,\"text\":\"Solo Vocal sections. Then came the Group Vocal （Hit） competitors. From them, five\"},{\"y\":0.26889534898679845,\"width\":0.18029350216166656,\"x\":0.11530398417423306,\"height\":0.011627906774464902,\"text\":\"inalists were named\"},{\"y\":0.2462152845773058,\"width\":0.7319830879218603,\"x\":0.18011901439005973,\"height\":0.01918235679402802,\"text\":\"The Grand Final took place on 5th December. It was very exciting. The whole\"},{\"y\":0.23387622163645694,\"width\":0.7987421130864887,\"x\":0.11320757165382024,\"height\":0.01612377788034247,\"text\":\"contest ended with a speech by Rev. Br. Tsui and the announcement of the results. The\"},{\"y\":0.21779642807973376,\"width\":0.7990158813132056,\"x\":0.1130567953003609,\"height\":0.019792014379843015,\"text\":\"judges said that most of the contestants did verv well, but some of them, especially the\"},{\"y\":0.20715026808753711,\"width\":0.48044673026112716,\"x\":0.11303234446112656,\"height\":0.01806614779494098,\"text\":\"vocalists, could not catch up with the accompaniment\"},{\"y\":0.20781758975736964,\"width\":0.26834382050909855,\"x\":0.6436058708775261,\"height\":0.011726384364820763,\"text\":\"the accompaniment was too\"},{\"y\":0.19283434235918906,\"width\":0.537049430782573,\"x\":0.11302703847727369,\"height\":0.018457523929956365,\"text\":\"heavy, and that these could be improved by more practice.\"},{\"y\":0.17696814307473419,\"width\":0.4469058735686883,\"x\":0.17800173592035856,\"height\":0.017873676436731767,\"text\":\"Talent Time is becoming more and more popular.\"},{\"y\":0.17877906990491876,\"width\":0.27044023171081255,\"x\":0.6415094472735244,\"height\":0.011774676319830535,\"text\":\"This can be noticed from the\"},{\"y\":0.16481030264220997,\"width\":0.403093081426755,\"x\":0.11288863838326696,\"height\":0.018476774482851344,\"text\":\"increase in the number of entries every year.\"},{\"y\":0.16151262989596737,\"width\":0.3777435963039453,\"x\":0.5343815061027882,\"height\":0.01821536707179161,\"text\":\"Above all, for the first time, we have Form\"},{\"y\":0.15261627904087038,\"width\":0.3186582635285601,\"x\":0.11320755905332995,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"text\":\"I students taking part and winning.\"},{\"y\":0.15261627917090714,\"width\":0.46960165000477716,\"x\":0.4402515780723846,\"height\":0.011627906774464902,\"text\":\"The ony thing that the organisers regret most is that\"},{\"y\":0.13808139567743294,\"width\":0.7966456731758584,\"x\":0.11320755177685085,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"text\":\"only a tew entered tor the Instrumental sections. Finally the Let's Together Club would\"},{\"y\":0.12348595579967547,\"width\":0.4511388884550653,\"x\":0.11301489177398934,\"height\":0.017426563474176815,\"text\":\"like to thank Rev. Fr. Deignan for his assistance，\"},{\"y\":0.12209302322691706,\"width\":0.3459119249489211,\"x\":0.5660377424521644,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"text\":\"the judges Mrs. Yung and Br. Tsui\"},{\"y\":0.10901162858735247,\"width\":0.7987421130864887,\"x\":0.11320755040120033,\"height\":0.01744185954041122,\"text\":\"and all those who gave a helping hand by providing the accompanimenis for the voc-\"},{\"y\":0.10029069772710864,\"width\":0.05031446455114873,\"x\":0.11320754843721385,\"height\":0.011761419314903154,\"text\":\"alists.\"},{\"y\":0.06831395367161908,\"width\":0.02306079595355863,\"x\":0.1111111114309775,\"height\":0.0131192713684678,\"text\":\"24\"}]",
