1437115,\"width\":0.7968620809876235,\"x\":0.11518651846051126,\"height\":0.018787961829368816,\"text\":\"flute and drums. It was really grand to see Form I students participating and winning in\"},{\"y\":0.29215116276180064,\"width\":0.7651991319342368,\"x\":0.11320754916216225,\"height\":0.014689228045435598,\"text\":\"them. It took place on 3rd December and was followed by the second Semi-Final of\"},{\"y\":0.274949673426059,\"width\":0.7969683039782749,\"x\":0.11512372303131364,\"height\":0.0199083396588553,\"text\":\"Solo Vocal sections. Then came the Group Vocal （Hit） competitors. From them, five\"},{\"y\":0.26889534898679845,\"width\":0.18029350216166656,\"x\":0.11530398417423306,\"height\":0.011627906774464902,\"text\":\"inalists were named\"},{\"y\":0.2462152845773058,\"width\":0.7319830879218603,\"x\":0.18011901439005973,\"height\":0.01918235679402802,\"text\":\"The Grand Final took place on 5th December. It was very exciting. The whole\"},{\"y\":0.23387622163645694,\"width\":0.7987421130864887,\"x\":0.11320757165382024,\"height\":0.01612377788034247,\"text\":\"contest ended with a speech by Rev. Br. Tsui and the announcement of the results. The\"},{\"y\":0.21779642807973376,\"width\":0.7990158813132056,\"x\":0.1130567953003609,\"height\":0.019792014379843015,\"text\":\"judges said that most of the contestants did verv well, but some of them, especially the\"},{\"y\":0.20715026808753711,\"width\":0.48044673026112716,\"x\":0.11303234446112656,\"height\":0.01806614779494098,\"text\":\"vocalists, could not catch up with the accompaniment\"},{\"y\":0.20781758975736964,\"width\":0.26834382050909855,\"x\":0.6436058708775261,\"height\":0.011726384364820763,\"text\":\"the accompaniment was too\"},{\"y\":0.19283434235918906,\"width\":0.537049430782573,\"x\":0.11302703847727369,\"height\":0.018457523929956365,\"text\":\"heavy, and that these could be improved by more practice.\"},{\"y\":0.17696814307473419,\"width\":0.4469058735686883,\"x\":0.17800173592035856,\"height\":0.017873676436731767,\"text\":\"Talent Time is becoming more and more popular.\"},{\"y\":0.17877906990491876,\"width\":0.27044023171081255,\"x\":0.6415094472735244,\"height\":0.011774676319830535,\"text\":\"This can be noticed from the\"},{\"y\":0.16481030264220997,\"width\":0.403093081426755,\"x\":0.11288863838326696,\"height\":0.018476774482851344,\"text\":\"increase in the number of entries every year.\"},{\"y\":0.16151262989596737,\"width\":0.3777435963039453,\"x\":0.5343815061027882,\"height\":0.01821536707179161,\"text\":\"Above all, for the first time, we have Form\"},{\"y\":0.15261627904087038,\"width\":0.3186582635285601,\"x\":0.11320755905332995,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"text\":\"I students taking part and winning.\"},{\"y\":0.15261627917090714,\"width\":0.46960165000477716,\"x\":0.4402515780723846,\"height\":0.011627906774464902,\"text\":\"The ony thing that the organisers regret most is that\"},{\"y\":0.13808139567743294,\"width\":0.7966456731758584,\"x\":0.11320755177685085,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"text\":\"only a tew entered tor the Instrumental sections. Finally the Let's Together Club would\"},{\"y\":0.12348595579967547,\"width\":0.4511388884550653,\"x\":0.11301489177398934,\"height\":0.017426563474176815,\"text\":\"like to thank Rev. Fr. Deignan for his assistance，\"},{\"y\":0.12209302322691706,\"width\":0.3459119249489211,\"x\":0.5660377424521644,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"text\":\"the judges Mrs. Yung and Br. Tsui\"},{\"y\":0.10901162858735247,\"width\":0.7987421130864887,\"x\":0.11320755040120033,\"height\":0.01744185954041122,\"text\":\"and all those who gave a helping hand by providing the accompanimenis for the voc-\"},{\"y\":0.10029069772710864,\"width\":0.05031446455114873,\"x\":0.11320754843721385,\"height\":0.011761419314903154,\"text\":\"alists.\"},{\"y\":0.06831395367161908,\"width\":0.02306079595355863,\"x\":0.1111111114309775,\"height\":0.0131192713684678,\"text\":\"24\"}]",
